WEBVTT

00:03.430 --> 00:04.790
So it's him?

00:04.790 --> 00:06.130
The margrave's son?

00:06.130 --> 00:06.890
Really?

00:06.890 --> 00:08.730
You're amazing!

00:08.730 --> 00:11.760
How did you defeat the Hafen boy?

00:11.760 --> 00:15.410
Maybe that idiot son of the marquis 
learned a lesson from this.

00:15.410 --> 00:16.900
Ah, don't tell him I said that.

00:17.310 --> 00:19.950
By the way, are you really a level 2?

00:19.950 --> 00:22.180
Have you considered a reassessment?

00:22.180 --> 00:23.950
W-Well...

00:27.670 --> 00:31.150
<i>When they asked me to come in, I thought 
I'd be immediately expelled,</i>

00:27.670 --> 00:33.420
<b>Gloomy...</b>

00:31.150 --> 00:33.420
<i>but they're all praising me to death...</i>

00:33.740 --> 00:34.910
<i>Good lord!</i>

00:34.910 --> 00:36.840
<i>This is all that upperclassman's fault!</i>

00:36.840 --> 00:37.730
<i>Dang it!</i>

00:37.730 --> 00:39.130
<i>How's he gonna make up for this?!</i>

00:39.430 --> 00:41.090
Hey, that's him, right?

00:41.090 --> 00:44.000
The guy who brought down Lord 
Schneidel with a single blow?

00:44.470 --> 00:47.500
I heard he's the son of Margrave Zenfis!

00:47.500 --> 00:50.490
He's got such a cute face. To think...

00:50.490 --> 00:51.450
<i>Huh?</i>

00:51.450 --> 00:54.830
<i>Wait, is the whole school talking about me?!</i>

00:55.460 --> 00:58.410
<i>I want to hole up in my 
room as soon as I can!</i>

00:59.820 --> 01:00.830
Oh?

01:00.830 --> 01:02.510
If it isn't Haruto!

01:02.510 --> 01:03.940
I absolutely refuse!

01:03.940 --> 01:05.860
I didn't say anything yet.

01:06.440 --> 01:08.950
Well now, I'm sorry about yesterday.

01:08.950 --> 01:12.450
I do realize I shouldn't have 
talked your ear off like that.

01:12.850 --> 01:16.180
With that said, won't you 
join my research lab?!

01:16.180 --> 01:20.710
<i>Oh, yeah, my copy did mention 
that she had cornered him.</i>

01:20.710 --> 01:23.970
Sorry, I forgot what we talked about.

01:23.970 --> 01:24.590
Bye!

01:24.850 --> 01:25.270
<b>Clench</b>

01:25.270 --> 01:26.760
Then I'm left with no choice.

01:26.760 --> 01:28.980
I'll explain everything one more time!

01:30.080 --> 01:32.540
<i>She never gives up, does she?</i>

01:51.460 --> 01:54.840
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

03:03.360 --> 03:08.910
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

03:03.530 --> 03:09.080
Episode 10

03:03.530 --> 03:09.080
<b>The Demon King's Name</b>

03:04.800 --> 03:05.900
Listen up.

03:05.900 --> 03:08.750
This academy offers two curricula,

03:08.750 --> 03:11.470
and you must enroll in one or the other.

03:11.470 --> 03:13.670
The first is the Knight's Course.

03:13.670 --> 03:17.260
You learn how to use and apply 
magic in the training rooms.

03:17.500 --> 03:22.220
It's a course for those looking to become a 
knight or a soldier in the kingdom's main army.

03:22.220 --> 03:24.930
The other is the Researcher's Course.

03:24.930 --> 03:26.530
You hole up in a research lab,

03:26.530 --> 03:28.330
develop new forms of magic,

03:28.330 --> 03:30.800
and scrabble to find ways 
to utilize them.

03:31.160 --> 03:33.020
From looking at your entrance exam,

03:33.020 --> 03:35.470
it seems you have an 
interest in ancient magic.

03:35.470 --> 03:36.690
Yes, I suppose...

03:36.690 --> 03:40.010
Then you should definitely work under me!

03:40.010 --> 03:42.610
No, I'd prefer any other lab than yours.

03:42.610 --> 03:45.220
With that decided, you just 
have to sign this sheet!

03:45.220 --> 03:47.030
I said I don't want to!

03:47.030 --> 03:47.750
Oh!

03:47.750 --> 03:49.730
Oh, there you are!

03:49.730 --> 03:51.210
I finally found you!

03:51.210 --> 03:54.180
Long time no see, Haruto!

03:55.160 --> 03:57.580
Ow, ow, ow!

03:57.580 --> 03:59.210
<i>Um...</i>

03:59.210 --> 04:02.000
<i>Who's this guy that suddenly attacked me?</i>

04:02.000 --> 04:03.300
Laius!

04:03.300 --> 04:04.300
Laius?

04:04.300 --> 04:05.690
Good grief!

04:05.690 --> 04:08.170
What a violent way to greet someone!

04:08.570 --> 04:10.390
<i>Marianne?</i>

04:10.760 --> 04:11.700
<i>Huh?</i>

04:12.980 --> 04:15.000
Ow, ow, ow!

04:13.870 --> 04:16.180
<i>This buff dude... is Laius?!</i>

04:16.450 --> 04:19.440
It's been so long, Haruto.

04:19.440 --> 04:22.490
<i>Marianne is as beautiful as always.</i>

04:22.490 --> 04:25.860
Wait, have you gotten even stronger?

04:25.860 --> 04:28.530
<i>Buff... He's so buff!</i>

04:28.940 --> 04:32.140
Um, do you have some business with me?

04:32.140 --> 04:33.460
Hey now!

04:33.460 --> 04:34.950
We're both new students here!

04:34.950 --> 04:36.160
No need for formalities!

04:36.160 --> 04:38.290
No, I was talking to the princess.

04:38.290 --> 04:39.300
What'd you say?!

04:39.570 --> 04:41.500
Come now, calm yourself.

04:41.780 --> 04:44.470
Haruto, have you decided 
on where to enroll yet?

04:44.470 --> 04:46.340
No, not yet.

04:46.340 --> 04:49.970
In that case, would you like 
to join my research lab?

04:49.970 --> 04:52.200
Hey, that's not fair!

04:52.200 --> 04:54.840
Haruto's going to be with <i>me</i>!

04:55.060 --> 04:56.800
Wait, hold it!

04:56.800 --> 04:59.530
He's already decided to join my lab!

04:59.760 --> 05:00.540
What?

05:00.540 --> 05:02.880
How is it fair for a teacher 
to be endorsing him?!

05:02.880 --> 05:04.290
Same goes for you!

05:04.290 --> 05:07.510
You may be royalty, but I won't back down!

05:07.240 --> 05:09.240
<b>Grrrrrrrr...</b>

05:09.980 --> 05:11.690
Wait, are you...

05:11.690 --> 05:14.280
Professor Tearietta Luseiannel?!

05:14.280 --> 05:15.280
Oh?

05:15.280 --> 05:17.950
The prince has heard of me?

05:17.950 --> 05:22.250
So the royal family is interested 
in my research, eh?

05:22.730 --> 05:24.980
Haruto, you really shouldn't go with her.

05:25.230 --> 05:28.840
She researches musty old magic,
 gets no worthwhile results,

05:28.840 --> 05:31.800
and is always arguing with 
the other teachers, I hear.

05:32.470 --> 05:34.120
Highness,

05:34.120 --> 05:35.900
it's not that my research gets no results.

05:35.900 --> 05:38.680
It's simply that none of you 
fools can understand it.

05:39.040 --> 05:41.120
See? That's how she is.

05:41.120 --> 05:42.060
Come again?!

05:42.060 --> 05:43.330
You're asking for a fight, punk!

05:43.330 --> 05:45.500
Haruto's going to enroll 
in the same lab as me!

05:45.500 --> 05:47.250
No, he's with me!

05:47.250 --> 05:48.950
You'll pick me, of course, won't you?

05:49.320 --> 05:50.490
Haruto!

05:50.490 --> 05:51.560
Well?

05:50.950 --> 05:51.910
Well?

05:51.560 --> 05:52.410
Well?!

05:52.410 --> 05:55.530
<i>Huh? What a pain!</i>

05:55.910 --> 05:57.570
E-Excuse me...

05:57.570 --> 05:58.940
Tsk! What now?!

05:58.940 --> 06:00.790
Are you here to steal Haruto, as well?!

06:00.790 --> 06:02.210
Ah, no...

06:02.210 --> 06:05.130
I j-just need to talk to him...

06:05.950 --> 06:06.920
<i>Huh?</i>

06:06.920 --> 06:08.810
<i>Is it something she can't discuss here?</i>

06:09.270 --> 06:11.350
<i>Hm? Wait a second.</i>

06:11.350 --> 06:15.350
<i>Can't I use this to get myself out of here?</i>

06:16.700 --> 06:18.430
Ah, so sorry.

06:18.430 --> 06:21.050
I forgot that I'd made plans with her.

06:21.050 --> 06:22.030
What?

06:22.030 --> 06:22.900
Later!

06:25.240 --> 06:26.410
Laius!

06:26.410 --> 06:28.930
Just what is that woman's 
relationship with Haruto?!

06:28.930 --> 06:30.640
Don't ask me!

06:31.620 --> 06:34.400
I'll never give up!

06:34.400 --> 06:41.670
up... up... up...

06:45.400 --> 06:47.700
Sorry for dragging you out like that.

06:47.700 --> 06:49.020
So, what'd you want?

06:49.020 --> 06:50.070
Right...

06:51.080 --> 06:54.480
First, though, I was curious about one thing.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.190
What is it?

06:57.380 --> 07:02.190
Are you the same person as 
the you I met yesterday?

07:03.140 --> 07:04.760
<i>What's with her?</i>

07:05.970 --> 07:07.360
What are you saying?

07:07.360 --> 07:12.310
To me, it seems that you're a completely 
different person from yesterday.

07:14.410 --> 07:15.520
<i>Whoops.</i>

07:15.520 --> 07:17.990
<i>I activated my alert 
mode out of pure reflex.</i>

07:18.410 --> 07:21.650
<i>That said, she can distinguish 
between me and my copy,</i>

07:21.650 --> 07:23.620
<i>so it's clear that she's no ordinary person.</i>

07:24.190 --> 07:25.730
What a surprise.

07:25.730 --> 07:27.160
This is a barrier, is it not?

07:27.420 --> 07:28.630
You can see it?

07:28.630 --> 07:31.600
No, I just sense it vaguely.

07:33.770 --> 07:37.010
So? How am I different from yesterday?

07:37.010 --> 07:42.110
Well, you give off the same 
impression as when we first met.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.570
However...

07:43.570 --> 07:47.170
When I met you yesterday, 
I didn't sense any mana at all.

07:47.170 --> 07:51.160
But today, I feel a force coming from 
you, almost enough to knock me down.

07:53.010 --> 07:58.680
<i>Maybe she's just a lot more sensitive 
to mana than other people.</i>

07:58.680 --> 08:01.450
<i>But it bothers me that she calls it a force.</i>

08:01.450 --> 08:05.040
<i>Flay's the only other one who's 
ever said something like that.</i>

08:06.500 --> 08:08.020
<i>So does that mean...</i>

08:09.380 --> 08:12.290
Wait, are you a demon?

08:19.020 --> 08:21.320
Does it look that way to you?

08:21.320 --> 08:22.310
No.

08:23.980 --> 08:29.110
I'd love to ask how you came up with 
that notion, but I think I'll refrain.

08:29.350 --> 08:31.010
I'm a human being.

08:31.010 --> 08:32.690
It'd be troublesome otherwise.

08:32.970 --> 08:36.340
<i>She words things in the weirdest way.</i>

08:36.340 --> 08:39.100
<i>Well, doesn't look like I need 
to be on guard with her.</i>

08:39.650 --> 08:45.810
As for your question, I'd appreciate it 
if you'd think of us as the same person.

08:45.810 --> 08:47.880
I can't say any more at the moment.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.760
Yes, I understand.

08:50.760 --> 08:53.350
So? Is that all you needed?

08:53.350 --> 08:55.100
Oh, that's right.

08:55.370 --> 08:58.300
I must apologize to you, thank you, 
and then ask of you a favor.

08:58.300 --> 08:59.310
<i>That's a lot.</i>

08:59.640 --> 09:01.250
First, my apology.

09:01.540 --> 09:05.520
I'm sorry for getting you caught 
up in trouble yesterday.

09:05.520 --> 09:10.670
And thank you for protecting me from 
Schneidel's attacks that followed.

09:11.160 --> 09:14.640
And finally, as for that favor...

09:15.080 --> 09:19.320
W-Will you be my friend?!

09:20.670 --> 09:21.530
Okay?

09:22.130 --> 09:23.580
Thank you!

09:23.580 --> 09:26.080
<i>Wait, I didn't mean that as a yes!</i>

09:26.660 --> 09:27.970
What a relief.

09:28.390 --> 09:31.020
I've never made a friend before!

09:31.020 --> 09:31.910
I'm so happy!

09:32.150 --> 09:33.300
Hold it!

09:33.300 --> 09:35.480
Wait, why me?

09:35.480 --> 09:40.060
I keep running into you, 
so I thought it might be fate.

09:40.060 --> 09:42.020
It's true that we keep 
running into each other...

09:42.240 --> 09:45.100
Wait, you don't have any friends?

09:45.100 --> 09:47.980
What was your life like until now?

09:47.980 --> 09:50.760
Will you listen to my story?

09:50.760 --> 09:52.220
S-Sure.

09:52.220 --> 09:54.030
<i>Keep it short, please.</i>

09:54.030 --> 09:55.680
The truth is...

09:55.680 --> 09:57.660
I was abandoned after I was born.

09:57.660 --> 10:00.750
<i>Whoa! This got real heavy real quick!</i>

10:00.980 --> 10:03.310
I continued to be abandoned by 
the people I ended up with.

10:03.310 --> 10:05.560
It happened four times in total.

10:05.560 --> 10:08.210
<i>And it's even heavier than 
what happened to me!</i>

10:05.750 --> 10:08.210
<b>Heavy baby</b>

10:08.650 --> 10:10.970
Wait, that's way too many times!

10:10.970 --> 10:12.800
There must have been a reason why.

10:12.800 --> 10:15.590
The only thing that comes to mind...

10:16.090 --> 10:19.940
is that I produced speech 
in order to communicate?

10:19.940 --> 10:21.380
<i>That's it!</i>

10:21.380 --> 10:23.020
<i>Makes sense.</i>

10:23.020 --> 10:27.880
<i>Any normal person would be freaked 
out if a baby started talking.</i>

10:28.210 --> 10:32.190
And so, in the end, I was 
taken in by a monastery,

10:32.190 --> 10:34.600
but even there, I found myself mistreated.

10:34.600 --> 10:37.560
The priest there, who was 
the one person kind to me,

10:37.560 --> 10:40.850
passed away when I was five years old.

10:40.850 --> 10:41.810
Oh...

10:42.070 --> 10:46.340
In what was already a secluded setting, 
I didn't interact with those around me,

10:46.340 --> 10:51.150
so it seems I'm lacking in common 
sense when it comes to human society.

10:51.670 --> 10:53.030
I see now.

10:53.030 --> 10:56.010
That's why you want to 
make friends and learn?

10:56.010 --> 10:56.720
Yes.

10:58.970 --> 11:01.950
In that case, you've got the wrong guy.

11:01.950 --> 11:02.600
What?

11:02.600 --> 11:07.460
Not to brag, but I also 
don't have any friends.

11:04.100 --> 11:07.270
<b>Past life included</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:11.300
I've always been a shut-in, and I 
don't have any common sense, either.

11:14.040 --> 11:15.970
That's perfect, then!

11:15.970 --> 11:18.030
Let's learn common sense together!

11:18.030 --> 11:19.230
<i>How'd you reach </i>that<i> conclusion?!</i>

11:19.590 --> 11:23.050
It seems that you and I 
are alike in some ways!

11:23.050 --> 11:23.800
<i>Huh?</i>

11:23.800 --> 11:26.060
<i>You mean like how we both 
give off loner vibes?</i>

11:26.060 --> 11:27.640
<i>Friends...</i>

11:27.640 --> 11:29.420
<i>Friends, huh?</i>

11:29.460 --> 11:38.800
Ride or Die

11:29.950 --> 11:32.800
<i>This is how I imagine them...</i>

11:32.800 --> 11:35.010
I'm hungry! Go buy us some bread!

11:35.010 --> 11:37.100
With <i>your</i> money, of course!

11:37.100 --> 11:38.790
We're friends, aren't we?

11:39.140 --> 11:41.260
<i>Hmm? In other words...</i>

11:41.260 --> 11:46.360
<i>Can I make use of her to get 
myself out of hassles at school?</i>

11:46.360 --> 11:48.300
<i>Then maybe being friends is okay.</i>

11:48.830 --> 11:51.600
By the way, have you decided 
on where to enroll?

11:51.600 --> 11:54.550
Yes, it's a research lab for ancient magic.

11:55.500 --> 11:58.680
<i>It's with that professor, of all people?!</i>

11:58.680 --> 11:59.950
Haruto!

11:59.950 --> 12:02.390
<i>But well, I'll just have to suck it up.</i>

12:03.210 --> 12:05.090
I'll pick that one, too, then.

12:05.090 --> 12:07.420
We're friends, so the same 
lab would be better.

12:07.420 --> 12:08.780
Really?!

12:09.770 --> 12:10.870
Friends...

12:11.690 --> 12:12.850
I see.

12:12.850 --> 12:16.580
Even after what I told you, 
you'll still be my friend.

12:17.420 --> 12:19.970
I'm so happy! Thank you!

12:24.080 --> 12:27.810
<i>Damn you and your smile 
that could rival Char's!</i>

12:27.810 --> 12:29.830
<i>You won't fool </i>me<i>!</i>

12:30.850 --> 12:33.400
Wait, you told me your life story,

12:33.400 --> 12:35.100
but you haven't introduced yourself.

12:35.430 --> 12:37.890
By the way, I'm Haruto Zenfis.

12:37.890 --> 12:39.540
My father is a margrave.

12:40.310 --> 12:42.770
Oh, you're right.

12:43.180 --> 12:47.420
I forgot that to communicate in human 
society, you start by giving your name.

12:49.230 --> 12:50.620
My name is...

12:58.540 --> 12:59.960
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

13:07.930 --> 13:15.060
<b>Sulk...</b>

13:08.340 --> 13:12.270
Ever since Haruto began attending school...

13:12.270 --> 13:15.060
I'm sad that there's less 
time to play with him...

13:16.150 --> 13:17.410
Don't say it!

13:17.410 --> 13:20.280
I want just as badly to be 
by Lord Haruto's side...

13:26.660 --> 13:28.860
I've just been struck 
with a flash of insight!

13:28.860 --> 13:32.760
A feeling that something interesting 
has happened to Haruto!

13:33.110 --> 13:35.250
I need to go and see for myself!

13:35.800 --> 13:39.980
Why won't Lord Haruto allow 
us to go and visit him?!

13:39.840 --> 13:42.090
<b>Because she'll likely
screw things up</b>

13:42.470 --> 13:43.830
Well, so be it.

13:43.830 --> 13:46.540
For now, I'll just enjoy this bath.

13:46.050 --> 13:46.550
<b>Hmph</b>

13:46.780 --> 13:49.060
You sure do move on quickly.

13:49.060 --> 13:51.020
I wouldn't be able to stand it otherwise!

13:51.470 --> 13:56.070
A servant is supposed to 
be at her master's side.

13:56.450 --> 13:58.970
But that's not what Lord Haruto wants.

13:58.970 --> 14:00.800
That's why I feel so conflicted.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.720
I see.

14:02.720 --> 14:04.690
You really do take this seriously.

14:05.060 --> 14:09.710
I didn't like serving other 
people and stuff like that.

14:09.710 --> 14:11.890
That's why I was all alone.

14:11.890 --> 14:14.700
You've adapted to this new lifestyle.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.890
I think that's plenty amazing.

14:18.620 --> 14:24.090
<b>Blush</b>

14:18.620 --> 14:24.090
<b>Blush</b>

14:18.630 --> 14:21.910
O-Oh, that's a lot of praise.

14:21.910 --> 14:24.080
You're making me blush!

14:24.320 --> 14:29.970
Well, my old job was to gather all 
of the demons near the Demon King.

14:29.970 --> 14:33.430
Huh? So you were on good 
terms with the Demon King?

14:33.430 --> 14:35.900
Yes. We were sworn allies.

14:36.260 --> 14:41.910
He was a kind soul, who always 
put demons and monsters first.

14:43.340 --> 14:48.360
But that kindness led him to disagree with 
other demons on how to treat humans.

14:48.360 --> 14:50.620
I had to step in between them often.

14:51.170 --> 14:57.100
His dream was to create a paradise 
where humans and demons could coexist.

14:58.500 --> 15:00.580
Thinking back on it,

15:00.580 --> 15:05.130
maybe he planned on losing to the Flash 
Princess without fighting her all along.

15:05.130 --> 15:06.300
What do you mean?

15:06.630 --> 15:08.980
When the Flash Princess came invading,

15:08.980 --> 15:12.400
he let all of the demons 
get away, of all things.

15:12.850 --> 15:16.430
Sacrificing himself for his own ideals...

15:16.430 --> 15:20.010
I'm sure he'd long planned 
on reincarnating as a human.

15:20.340 --> 15:23.290
You mean he'd become human,

15:23.290 --> 15:26.820
and then try and change the 
humans' attitudes from within?

15:27.080 --> 15:27.790
Indeed.

15:28.250 --> 15:31.910
I had no idea the Demon King had 
given it that much thought...

15:32.410 --> 15:36.990
Well, I never did like that 
wishful thinking of his.

15:37.510 --> 15:43.210
But to think he'd be born from the womb of 
the very same Flash Princess who killed him...

15:43.210 --> 15:45.460
It's beyond my wildest imagination.

15:45.760 --> 15:49.800
Lord Haruto told me that he lost all 
his memories prior to reincarnation.

15:50.170 --> 15:55.800
Maybe he did it to discard the naïveté 
that kept him from becoming ruthless.

15:56.240 --> 15:59.870
The Demon King often abbreviated 
the name of our species.

15:59.870 --> 16:04.660
So imagine my surprise when 
Lord Haruto gave me that name.

16:05.010 --> 16:09.480
Back then, I almost used his name 
back from the Demon King days.

16:10.100 --> 16:14.200
That reminds me, I don't know 
what the Demon King's name is.

16:14.470 --> 16:16.700
Make sure you don't carelessly 
say it out loud.

16:17.710 --> 16:19.660
The Demon King's name is...

16:19.990 --> 16:21.510
Irisphilia.

16:23.400 --> 16:25.090
Irisphilia, huh?

16:25.770 --> 16:26.870
That's long.

16:26.870 --> 16:27.920
Can I just call you Iris?

16:32.320 --> 16:33.590
I'm sorry.

16:33.590 --> 16:37.150
I also used to shorten names 
a lot back in the day.

16:37.150 --> 16:40.820
You just happened to remind me of back then.

16:41.190 --> 16:45.870
Well, now that we're friends, 
I'll be taking my leave.

16:45.870 --> 16:47.650
Oh, hold on, Haruto.

16:47.650 --> 16:50.850
Incidentally, have you finished 
signing up for classes?

16:51.420 --> 16:53.200
No, not yet.

16:53.200 --> 16:55.670
Why don't we do it together, right now?!

16:55.670 --> 16:56.270
Eh?

16:56.570 --> 16:59.720
Working together will be 
a lot more efficient!

16:59.720 --> 17:01.250
O-Okay.

17:01.610 --> 17:04.200
Okay, how about my room, then?

17:04.200 --> 17:06.680
Yes! That sounds great!

17:06.680 --> 17:09.970
<i>She sure is assertive...</i>

17:17.460 --> 17:18.590
<i>Huh?</i>

17:18.590 --> 17:21.620
<i>I invited Iris to my room without thinking...</i>

17:21.620 --> 17:24.130
<i>But wait, she's a girl!</i>

17:24.130 --> 17:27.420
<i>That said, it'd be weird 
to turn her away now.</i>

17:27.780 --> 17:31.060
<i>Let's just get it over with, 
so she leaves quickly.</i>

17:32.720 --> 17:35.030
Haruto, welcome ba—

17:37.340 --> 17:39.990
Is that person your...

17:39.990 --> 17:40.580
lov—

17:40.580 --> 17:41.700
My friend!

17:41.700 --> 17:43.690
Oh, thank goodness.

17:42.160 --> 17:42.790
<b>Phew</b>

17:43.690 --> 17:46.930
That flash of insight was 
because you made a friend.

17:46.930 --> 17:47.910
<i>Flash of insight?</i>

17:48.290 --> 17:50.480
And I'd expect no less from you!

17:50.480 --> 17:53.340
You've made such a wonderful 
friend so quickly!

17:53.620 --> 17:58.970
Indeed, I'm sure it'd be simple for you 
to find yourself five to ten lovers.

17:58.970 --> 18:02.030
Which means that I'll need 
to fully prepare myself.

18:02.030 --> 18:02.940
<i>For what?!</i>

18:02.940 --> 18:07.130
After all, I plan on becoming 
your second wife, give or take!

18:07.130 --> 18:08.770
<i>How did </i>that<i> happen?!</i>

18:08.770 --> 18:09.470
Hug!

18:09.470 --> 18:12.180
Hey, cut that out! Not in front of others!

18:13.350 --> 18:17.860
<i>Oh, I know, this must be that thing kids do.</i>

18:17.860 --> 18:21.060
When I grow up, I'm going to marry you!

18:21.060 --> 18:22.800
<i>Before long...</i>

18:22.800 --> 18:23.460
What?

18:23.460 --> 18:25.710
You're seriously creepy.

18:25.710 --> 18:27.940
<i>If she ends up like that, I'll cry!</i>

18:28.290 --> 18:30.560
You can do whatever you want, Char.

18:30.560 --> 18:32.200
Thank you!

18:32.200 --> 18:36.980
Should I consider that a normal 
conversation between siblings?

18:36.980 --> 18:38.340
Probably.

18:38.610 --> 18:40.260
You've met before, right?

18:40.260 --> 18:42.340
This is Iris, my friend as of today.

18:42.340 --> 18:44.600
And this is my sister, Char.

18:44.850 --> 18:47.640
<b>Bow</b>

18:45.010 --> 18:48.120
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

18:47.640 --> 18:50.190
<b>Bow</b>

18:48.120 --> 18:49.860
Yes, same here.

18:50.890 --> 18:51.870
Char.

18:51.870 --> 18:54.470
Sorry, but we've got something to do.

18:54.470 --> 18:55.860
I understand!

19:06.510 --> 19:07.950
Haruto.

19:07.950 --> 19:11.010
Is there some sort of 
magical meaning to that?

19:11.920 --> 19:14.210
I'm just choosing my classes.

19:14.210 --> 19:16.630
If you'll allow me to explain...

19:16.630 --> 19:22.370
No matter what he picks, 
it'll be easy-peasy for Haruto!

19:23.260 --> 19:24.830
I don't understand at all.

19:24.830 --> 19:26.590
<i>Yeah, I'll bet.</i>

19:29.140 --> 19:30.060
Man, what a pain

19:30.260 --> 19:31.280
Char.

19:31.280 --> 19:34.500
Can you pick out some classes 
that would suit me?

19:35.280 --> 19:37.200
I would be absolutely honored!

19:37.200 --> 19:41.280
I hereby vow to live up 
to your expectations!

19:43.240 --> 19:45.200
<b>Bam</b>

19:43.580 --> 19:44.850
I've finished!

19:45.500 --> 19:46.840
Good work.

19:46.840 --> 19:47.910
You really helped me out.

19:47.910 --> 19:50.790
You're not going to look 
over what she wrote?

19:50.790 --> 19:53.320
Char picked them out, 
so there should be no problem.

19:54.530 --> 19:58.180
I never knew that you placed 
so much trust in me!

19:58.180 --> 20:00.070
Why, you're making me blush!

19:58.880 --> 20:00.090
<b>Blush</b>

20:00.430 --> 20:05.110
Didn't you enter this academy because 
you had something to accomplish?

20:06.760 --> 20:10.770
Haruto's goal lies outside of academics.

20:11.960 --> 20:13.800
What goal do you speak of?

20:16.650 --> 20:20.020
I can't divulge that, not even to a friend.

20:20.600 --> 20:21.480
Iris.

20:22.290 --> 20:27.440
The very assumption that Haruto is here 
to learn from others is mistaken!

20:27.440 --> 20:32.790
Haruto has already far 
transcended such conventions!

20:27.450 --> 20:32.410
<b>Ka-blaaaaam</b>

20:32.790 --> 20:35.380
T-Transcended?!

20:35.770 --> 20:37.710
H-Haruto...

20:38.410 --> 20:40.960
I never knew you were so incredible!

20:40.960 --> 20:42.750
<i>Ah, not good.</i>

20:42.750 --> 20:44.040
<i>She's totally bought it.</i>

20:44.380 --> 20:47.520
<i>I can't let Char wreak any more havoc.</i>

20:47.520 --> 20:50.010
Oh, yeah, why are you here?

20:50.840 --> 20:54.410
It seems I've already 
accomplished my goal here.

20:54.410 --> 20:56.060
I'll be going back now.

20:56.060 --> 20:58.480
<i>Huh? Ah, okay, then.</i>

20:58.780 --> 21:01.440
I bid you farewell, Iris.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.520
Ah, yes.

21:02.520 --> 21:03.950
Until next time, Char.

21:03.950 --> 21:06.800
<i>I can't let her see the Anyplace Door.</i>

21:06.800 --> 21:07.580
Huh?

21:07.580 --> 21:10.300
By the way, how did you make 
your way on campus...

21:07.950 --> 21:09.080
<b>Slither, slither...</b>

21:10.300 --> 21:12.370
Excuse me for a moment!

21:16.630 --> 21:21.370
I just heard a door open from somewhere 
other than the entrance...

21:21.370 --> 21:23.360
Don't sweat the details!

21:26.820 --> 21:29.170
Okay, that does it.

21:29.700 --> 21:30.470
Well...

21:30.840 --> 21:32.790
let's work hard, Iris.

21:32.790 --> 21:34.920
<i>Until the day I get expelled!</i>

21:34.920 --> 21:36.460
Ah, yeah.

21:36.850 --> 21:38.280
You, too, Haruto.

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
Episode Preview

23:09.730 --> 23:11.130
Charlotte here!

23:11.130 --> 23:14.480
Today, I let Iris know 
how amazing Haruto is!

23:14.480 --> 23:17.330
But I sense that something 
is about to go wrong!

23:17.330 --> 23:19.560
Next episode: "I Got Myself Mixed 
Up With So Many People...".

23:17.500 --> 23:24.000
<b>I Got Myself Mixed Up with so Many People...</b>

23:19.560 --> 23:22.790
Haruto, school really is a scary place!
